下面是实现二分查找算法的Java代码：
```java
public static int binarySearch(int[] arr, int target) {
    int left = 0;
    int right = arr.length - 1;
    while (left <= right) {
        int mid = (left + right) / 2;
        if (arr[mid] == target) {
            return mid;
        } else if (arr[mid] < target) {
            left = mid + 1;
        } else {
            right = mid - 1;
        }
    }
    return -1;
}
```
对于给定的排序整数数组[2, 5, 7, 10, 15, 18, 20]，如果要查找目标值10，则只需调用该方法，并将数组和目标值作为参数传递：
```java
int[] arr = {2, 5, 7, 10, 15, 18, 20};
int target = 10;
int result = binarySearch(arr, target);
System.out.println(result); // 输出 3，表示在数组中找到目标值10，它的下标是3
```

